{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "e1b0fba784144dee40c8b1938c69de75ffb66dd389c00f56bc0a09a8e3091d36", "ja": "デート、プラスワン", "zh": "约会加一人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b166e6014ba3017b2f9fcdb62495768c71aa0802bddf585c2af5c062265d18b3", "ja": "可憐と律子のデートの日。プロデューサーも\nカメラマン兼荷物持ちとして呼ばれていた。\nお互いのお気に入りの場所を巡りながら、楽\nしそうに笑い合うふたりを見て、成長を感じ\nるプロデューサーなのだった。", "zh": "可怜和律子约会的那天，制作人也\n作为摄影师兼搬运工被叫了过去。\n看着两人逛着彼此中意的地方、开\n心地相视而笑，制作人感受到了她们的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "45d1b03bf38edf5c3419a23481158a46e80ff17dd66433b99173c5875ef1146b", "ja": "（地方公演から帰ってきて、数日が経った。\n今日は律子と可憐がデートの約束をしている……）", "zh": "（地方公演回来后，已经过了几天。\n今天律子和可怜约好了要约会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e645133ffbd52ce8a76b50267996ccfd4ffa1353d6271741683984eb026b8f92", "ja": "ふたりのデートなのに、\nどうして俺まで呼ばれたんだ？", "zh": "明明是你们两个人约会，为什么连我也被叫来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "bbf9aed044ccc22709b86544a3121d9fcfff71d361ed8c9e45f74be3b2e704e3", "ja": "それはもちろん、私たちがアイドルだからに\n決まってるじゃありませんか！", "zh": "当然是因为我们是偶像啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "8c31a9368289269dc03a543e778cc0dc19d44279268e9c29a801cf2a94b4f6b6", "ja": "与えられたお仕事はきっちりこなしたんですから、\nオフの日も、きっちり付き合っていただかないと♪", "zh": "既然交给我们的工作都已经一丝不苟地完成了，休息日也请您务必陪陪我们才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "ab8ba9fb55db6e3a05d9ff1014da032e5dca1b2bd4d06fde1d3c745e4ff1aa42", "ja": "{$P$}さん……お、お休みなのに\nすみません……私たちと一緒は、イヤ、ですか……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……明、明明是休息日，却还来打扰您……\n您不愿意和我们一起吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3afd94afaf4a981919d245af2b15506dcd6aa1d1b83467735b009a270ebd0308", "ja": "いや、そんな事はないけど……。\nふたりの邪魔にならないかなと思って。", "zh": "倒也不是那样，只是……我在想，会不会打扰你们两个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "de5ebcb2fba0269826a933281faca68171f4e17fac438023d7c4235992341caa", "ja": "そこは大丈夫です！　{$P$}にも\n楽しんでもらおうと、可憐と一緒に考えたプランだし。", "zh": "这点没问题！这是我和可怜一起想的计划，也希望能让{$P$}玩得开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "2a32c5e35ae534dd33b90f87f72338b8eaaf1f433fddbd58cfea6c9a65ea7d38", "ja": "は、はい……！　私のオススメと、律子さんの\nオススメ……両方に行く、デート……です。", "zh": "是、是的……！这是去我推荐的地方，还有律子小姐推荐的地方……两边都去的约会……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "cfa467804d83b41b746794c31bec8cd94e3b9a07d078f4eec4e8f432713b0fed", "ja": "というわけで。今日はよろしくお願いしますね？\n{$P$}！", "zh": "那么，今天还请多多关照哦？{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1009_se", "source_sha256": "24d240d552031bc72d6ecebb05f65390326b0b319880d385c222e07f67c373c4", "ja": "カシャ", "zh": "咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e3aca4315c2f91287ea4d1ffe9f64b6a07106579a386398d36ad5202bb86180f", "ja": "なるほど……\nつまり、カメラマンが必要だったというわけか。", "zh": "原来如此……\n也就是说，是需要一位摄影师啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "5dfd17f688e81b0defbe96155cf7f339f7a380f96138e5a7abd292b7cd8ddaf2", "ja": "それだけじゃありませんけどね。でもアイドルの\nオフショットは、劇場の宣伝に使えると思いませんか？", "zh": "不只是这样。不过，您不觉得偶像的花絮照也能用来宣传剧场吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "d13147f4bd40991a90933dabb5b4c181f6b162b68847fda42774ac241af05751", "ja": "さ、さすが律子さん……！　私なんて、\nデートが楽しみとしか、考えてませんでした……。", "zh": "果、果然是律子姐……！我却只想着约会很令人期待……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "854857c06bf41beee9f903c70a65ff434240a58e9b9c7924f74cc98cb4a8e509", "ja": "オフだもの、私だって当然楽しむつもりよ？\nそろそろ、可憐オススメのお店に行きましょうか！", "zh": "毕竟是休息日，我当然也打算好好享受啊？\n差不多该去可怜推荐的店了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "dbaea50984bd14f2a82e31a74a1684e88ab00d104a1de4ddc184ff41866308a5", "ja": "わ……私のオススメは、ここです……\n素敵なお店で、とっても落ち着くんです……♪", "zh": "这……这里就是我推荐的店……\n是一家很棒的店，待在里面会让人特别放松……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0b48f2375689b39f3ee78f453e2db29e3a89a8a2d3a2e201b1911f5ce0283b8c", "ja": "アロマショップか。\n可憐の行きつけだけあって、すごい品数だな。", "zh": "是香薰店啊。\n不愧是可怜常去的店，商品种类真多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "6f0d04969153dbacc6fdfcaf63eb2458510802e9b6c148b6732c7892fa065008", "ja": "本当、こんなに種類があるのね。\n……ねえ、可憐はどうしてアロマが好きなの？", "zh": "真的有这么多种类啊。\n……对了，可怜为什么喜欢香薰呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "f6431f790d793dfe4650b1914965ad63cd50b5a8daa4b5a0841a387f65173b45", "ja": "えっと……最初は、落ち着くからで……。でも、\nいろいろ試しているうちに、楽しくなってきて……。", "zh": "那个……一开始是因为能让人平静下来……可是，尝试了各种各样的香味之后，就渐渐觉得有意思起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "27ddac8f40755e53c1776ea744731b702c494d85e11ae9eb592b46d6497dbefb", "ja": "き、気がついたら、すっかり夢中になってて……\n人にも、いろいろ教えてあげられますし……。", "zh": "回、回过神来，已经完全沉浸其中了……\n而且，也能教给别人不少东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "07df70012140ea043c5442f5919b5a34b5aa8a72231c895b99aea6bd28281c56", "ja": "アロマセラピストって資格があるくらいだものね。\nふむ……覚えておくと、実用的かもしれないわ。", "zh": "毕竟都有芳香疗法师这样的资格证呢。嗯……记住这些，说不定还挺实用的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "bbf41f5f59ef402d5e80c237fb7e088e70e64dafbd66cba908ad8487f5cdc92a", "ja": "も、もし律子さんがアロマを覚えたいなら、私……\n知ってること、全部教えます……！", "zh": "如、如果律子小姐想学芳疗的话，我……\n会把知道的都教给你的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "253b9a1250b19a5c1991588047aa49d61b330a7534fb6e42cd83bf0c47ffbfe5", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう。\nそれじゃ手始めに、ひとつ選んでみようかしら。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n那就先试着选一个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "573a14bca105a6563472a33d8581c7b101a0ff3e9eaf568cf633157904a7ae69", "ja": "は、はい……！\n私も、お手伝いします……！", "zh": "是、是……！\n我也来帮忙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "917f19facb76a9634b3a8591a5f2381545bbfa29e942756a0b76829b0a32d6c9", "ja": "それじゃあ今度は、私の番ね。\n私のオススメは、ここよ！", "zh": "那么接下来轮到我了。\n我推荐的是这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "0ae98ce1534cf8073644194c572f2da3c1c2b020e8b968a81acb98759cf25395", "ja": "ここは……で、電気屋さん、でしょうか……？", "zh": "这里是……电、电子产品店吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "fbc900fd4d3959fe3a6ad222f699feaf478ee07dfb0398f6a933b3303b565811", "ja": "そう！　新製品はチェックすることにしてるの。\n今日は……そうね、タブレットでも見ようかしら。", "zh": "没错！我一直都有关注新产品的习惯。\n今天……嗯，去看看平板电脑吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "0efd74c62cdb4fd02741c6d82d7cbe24bcd396d121f13bf946a4c4ff76be6513", "ja": "スマホやタブレットはアイドルの情報収集はもちろん、\n情報発信にも使えるでしょ。今や必須アイテムよ！", "zh": "手机和平板不仅能收集偶像相关信息，还能用来发布消息，对吧。现在已经是必备物品了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0eebbe9753d7ac9ea00777dfb15c8e644cec8aea2a32725c4fab6bc47f687d4f", "ja": "確かに、どっちも便利なだけじゃなく、戦略として\n使えるな。ファンの人達も活用してるし……。", "zh": "确实，这两样不只是方便，还能作为策略来运用。粉丝们也都在活用……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "b2e03a96b2161e7c01c29ab52e029c7d6140fc96f1a7b06581cb007d88307c44", "ja": "べ、勉強になります……！", "zh": "真、真是受教了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "f7b100d5436f8c2230c562c8bc9c91caab6f76d388a5194621695e2e4175f614", "ja": "{$P$}さん、律子さん……。\n今日は本当に、ありがとうございました……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生、律子小姐……\n今天真的很谢谢你们……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9dd933bd900763228ba629bf81de29058f798c3e512add76274d7d87e0f7aeb4", "ja": "可憐こそ、お疲れさま。\n俺もいいリフレッシュになったよ。", "zh": "可怜才辛苦了呢。\n我也好好放松了一下哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "a9aae2e56d5aaa22179e406a479a2f11470a785f3b375e80f311201f063c5ec2", "ja": "今日のデートもですけど、地方公演でも……ね。\nいろいろ、迷惑かけましたし。", "zh": "不只是今天的约会，在地方公演时也是……对吧。给你添了不少麻烦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "5ed6cda4ee85c2e41cb7d2c3ef1d38353493719d41b4c9827ec17c250fe65a1b", "ja": "そ、それで……律子さんと、今日は何か\nお礼をしようって、話してたんです。それで……。", "zh": "所、所以……我和律子小姐商量着，今天想做点什么表示感谢。就是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "25c3571671e4bc1152e887d16b38ac19564846309686e0e9974b452383cf236d", "ja": "これ。私たちから、今回のお礼ってことで。\n遠慮しないでくださいね。", "zh": "这个，是我们为了感谢这次的事情送给您的。  \n请别客气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_1034", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2000_p", "source_sha256": "357e8d21dcf8947186dd042daaa73baa51ced666676c3b32132639dde7162d7b", "ja": "そんな事、気にしなくていいのに……\nあれ？　なんだか、いい香りがするな？", "zh": "那种事，你不用在意的……  \n咦？怎么感觉有股好香的味道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2001_009rit", "source_sha256": "a225bbc31292544561b8d6de7c1be957d4af22ab0df8bd0ff43ffd5e47410f5c", "ja": "お疲れの{$P$}殿が、事務室でも\nよく眠れるように。可憐と一緒に、選びました。", "zh": "为了让疲惫的{$P$}先生在办公室也能睡得更香。我和可怜一起挑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2002_045kar", "source_sha256": "f44a20906d1e2ac6aacdf1aba1741a66ea340f100964959ad317ba57d4946549", "ja": "香り付きの、アイマスクです……\nよ、よかったら、使ってください……♪", "zh": "是带香味的眼罩……如、如果不嫌弃的话，请用用看……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2003_p", "source_sha256": "e86bb499df7cd8d8edded91c03ad24f07228b01d9c15c58e1aa71253ba384419", "ja": "そうか……ありがとう。\n大事に使わせてもらうよ。", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢你。\n我会好好珍惜着用的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2004_009rit", "source_sha256": "bd0713938fa9923e11f6e901451b8bea152994353fdb56819e4eaf567d9f0192", "ja": "可憐とのデュオ、やらせてもらってよかったです。\n私自身、気付かされることが多かったので。", "zh": "能和可怜组成双人组合，真是太好了。\n我自己也从中注意到了很多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2005_045kar", "source_sha256": "f2989c1e1e310fa8a17672d726c41095b0e643ffa462d9a55b7f9f9260ee45fb", "ja": "わ、私も、たくさん勉強になりました……。\n律子さんと一緒で、良かったです……。", "zh": "我、我也学到了很多……\n能和律子小姐一起，真是太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2006_009rit", "source_sha256": "546d6fa0b0a0a15bc43d8dfad7ff30ef4bfa239780c79e519d67d80ae17ba4a3", "ja": "それじゃ、そろそろ帰りましょうか？　また明日から\nよろしくお願いしますね、{$P$}。", "zh": "那么，我们差不多该回去了吧？从明天开始，也请多多关照，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2007_045kar", "source_sha256": "c4100328dd42cdf8334ac49ece391256124e539e8e83d89eccf1fe11fa99e746", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nわ、私も、がんばりますね……てへへ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我、我也会努力的……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_07_2008_p", "source_sha256": "bf24223692e33e9dab8f08e2537660618360c1098057fe45ee509ba2159eaafd", "ja": "（ゆっくりだけど、アイドルは日々成長している……\n俺もしっかり休んで、明日からまた頑張らないとな）", "zh": "（虽然进步得很慢，但偶像每天都在成长……\n我也得好好休息，从明天开始继续努力才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
